# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Projectory — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in what you need.
# `.env.local` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# The app runs with NO configuration at all. Everything below is optional.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Clerk (optional) -------------------------------------------------------
# Member 1's target auth provider per the team plan. Until these are set, the
# app falls back to a local credentials provider so it stays fully runnable and
# demoable. Create a free account at https://clerk.com and paste the keys from
# its dashboard. Setting BOTH automatically switches auth over to Clerk.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# --- Database (Member 3's territory) ----------------------------------------
# Member 3 owns PostgreSQL + Drizzle. He reads the connection string from
# DATABASE_URL and owns anything added below.
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/projectory
